### Describe the bug

After version `1.37.0`, Bruno stopped using collection `script:pre-request` and `script:post-response` scripts when introspecting the GraphQL schema.

This is specially critical for collections that rely on the `pre-request` scripts to set custom tokens or update the url.

It seems that the change that broke introspection was introduced in this commit: https://github.com/usebruno/bruno/commit/ee715a6dc6449b3d3df576134d1033add2eb56b2

Or more specifically this change here: [ee715a6 diff](https://github.com/usebruno/bruno/commit/ee715a6dc6449b3d3df576134d1033add2eb56b2#diff-eaeb1da31271859ebecb449a3291ab31d513dbee71aff0df896001827f94cc90R400)

