### Describe the bug

Using an _unquoted_ variable in the value of a field in a JSON body causes any comments in the body to be sent on the request instead of stripped. This also breaks the prettier.

e.g.

```
{
  "test": {{testVar}} //test
}
```

is sent as 

```
data "{\n \"test\": 1234 //test\n}\n"
```

and is prettied into

```
{
  "test": {
    {testVar
    }
  }     //test
}
```

whereas

```
{
  "test": "{{testVar}}" //test
}
```

is sent as

```
data {"test":"1234"}
```

and is unchanged by prettify.


